{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\dfrac{e^x}{\\sqrt{x}}$ is the quotient of two, more basic, expressions: $e^x$ and $\\sqrt{x}$.\n\nTherefore, the derivative of the expression can be found using **the quotient rule**:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac{u(x)}{v(x)}\\right]\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}[u(x)]v(x)-u(x)\\dfrac{d}{dx}[v(x)]}{[v(x)]^2}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{u'(x)v(x)-u(x)v'(x)}{[v(x)]^2}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's differentiate!\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{e^x}{\\sqrt{x}}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}(e^x)\\sqrt{x}-e^x\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\sqrt{x})}{(\\sqrt{x})^2}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{The quotient rule}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{e^x\\cdot \\sqrt{x}-e^x\\cdot \\dfrac1{2\\sqrt{x}}}{(\\sqrt{x})^2}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{Differentiate }e^x\\text{ and }\\sqrt{x}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{e^x\\left(\\sqrt{x}-\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\right)}{x}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{Simplify}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{e^x}{\\sqrt{x}}\\right)=\\dfrac{e^x\\left(\\sqrt{x}-\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\right)}{x}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Find $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{e^x}{\\sqrt{x}}\\right)$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\dfrac{e^x\\left(\\sqrt{x}-\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\right)}{x}$","correct":true},{"content":"$e^x-\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}$","correct":false},{"content":"$e^x\\left(\\sqrt{x}-\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\right)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$2\\sqrt{x}e^x$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
